{"type":"put","record":{"id":"51666dc945d0bd813ee0a621b37ccb10","revision":"3ef2afd4674f57231d70c7dd71abb59b","text":"Q: Which session branch is used to resolve the reference?\nA: It uses sessionManager.getBranch() when available, falling back to getEntries(). The sessionManager is captured at session_start/session_switch and read at validation time, so the current branch is used.\nTask: Document how TaskManage resolves tool:Name#n evidence","tags":["taskmanage-answer","evidence-anchored","Document how TaskManage resolves tool:Name#n evidence"],"namespace":"default","status":"verified","kind":"fact","evidence":[{"ref":"packages/tools/taskmanage/src/task-manage.ts#L1071-L1071","quote":"const entries = session.getBranch?.() ?? session.getEntries();"},{"ref":"packages/tools/taskmanage/src/task-manage.ts#L1137-L1137","quote":"options.resolveSessionEvidence ??= reference => resolveToolEvidence(reference, sessionManager);"}],"source":"taskmanage-answer:/Users/swarm/Work/Clover/trebol/artifacts/memory-pilot/runs/pair-01-f35d6a0/t1/agent/sessions/--private-tmp-trebol-pilot-ws-f35d6a0ed611-7e659f0f--/2026-10-18T16-13-28-547Z_01a14fca-1e62-7590-85f1-94ed5a112b40.jsonl:1:q3","scope":"worktree","createdAt":"2026-10-18T16:13:55.301Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-18T16:13:55.301Z"},"revision":"3ef2afd4674f57231d70c7dd71abb59b","at":"2026-10-18T16:13:55.301Z"}